#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I start a new game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press the <guibutton>New</guibutton> button, select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> from the menubar or press <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;"
"<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I redirect ships once they have left a planet?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "No, once ships leave a planet, they cannot be stopped or redirected."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:328
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do the different colors and shapes of planets mean anything?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid "No, they are random."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid "How can I know where my ships are?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click <guibutton>Show Standings</guibutton>. It will give you information "
"about fleets currently in flight."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have lost all my planets, but I am still in the game, why?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid "You have not lost the game until you have lost all your ships."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid "I am running out of turns, what can I do?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can continue playing. When you are at the last turn, you will be "
"prompted to add more."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I store ships on a planet for later use?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:385
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes, you should however store them on multiple planets to be able to send "
"them to nearby planets."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:393
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have sent out all the ships on a planet, but when I move my mouse over the "
"planet, it shows the ships still in place, why?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid "The number of ships on a planet is updated when a turn is ended."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:406
#, no-c-format
msgid "Is it possible to change the theme?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid "No, that is not possible at the moment."
